I want to be clear that my intent was never to shut down legitimate challenge, but I also recognize that intent doesn't equal impact, and I own that the way I managed those moments fell short of what the role requires.

I do have a specific follow-up commitment I'd like to put on the record. I'm willing to complete a 42-day coaching plan focused on receiving challenge without shutting down discussion. I want to state that here as my concrete commitment for the written case record."}

